
{
  "content": "\n    <h3 id=\"lecture-17\">Lecture 17</h3>\n\n<p>This class session was devoted to student presentations of their <a     href=\"https://draft.ocw.mit.edu/courses/18-642-topics-in-mathematics-with-applications-in-finance-fall-2024/pages/group-project/\"  >mid-semester group project</a>.        <br>\nNote: The student presentations are not available to OCW learners.</p>\n<p>See <a href=\"../../pages/problem-sets/index.html\">Problem Set 5</a></p>\n\n    <h3 id=\"lecture-18\">Lecture 18</h3>\n\n<p>Guest lecture with Andrew W. Lo, MIT Sloan School of Management</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n<div class=\"video-embed video-player-wrapper\">\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  <div class=\"show-offline alert alert-warning\" role=\"alert\">\n    \n    \n      <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\">\n  <path d=\"M0 0h24v24H0z\" fill=\"none\"/>\n  <path d=\"M15.5 14h-.79l-.28-.27C15.41 12.59 16 11.11 16 9.5 16 5.91 13.09 3 9.5 3S3 5.91 3 9.5 5.91 16 9.5 16c1.61 0 3.09-.59 4.23-1.57l.27.28v.79l5 4.99L20.49 19l-4.99-5zm-6 0C7.01 14 5 11.99 5 9.5S7.01 5 9.5 5 14 7.01 14 9.5 11.99 14 9.5 14z\" fill=\"#ffffff\"/>\n</svg>\n\n    \n    Viewing videos requires an internet connection\n  </div>\n\n<div class=\"video-container embedded-video-container youtube-container\">\n  <video\n    id=\"video-player-_e2nDnV7FQs-36410f92f3dca990459c9aa1ffce5c84\"\n    class=\"video-js vjs-default-skin vjs-big-play-centered vjs-ocw\"\n    controls\n    data-downloadlink = \"../../static_resources/18642-lecture-18-version-5_360p_16_9.mp4\"\n    data-transcriptlink = \"../../static_resources/18642-lecture-18-version-5_transcript.pdf\"\n    \n  >\n      \n        \n        <track kind=\"captions\" src=\"../../static_resources/18642-lecture-18-version-5_captions.vtt\" srclang=\"en\" label=\"English\" default mode=\"showing\">\n        \n      \n  </video>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<script>\n  window.handleVideoJSError = function(